    "detailed_description": "Chorus of the Night is a fast-paced twin-stick shooter where you battle through hordes of quirky enemies drawn from the music scenes of the '90s and early 2000s. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231630/extras/c67a50bb59e1bebffb134492e5a0b13f.poster.avif?t=1672176547\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231630/extras/c67a50bb59e1bebffb134492e5a0b13f.webm?t=1672176547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231630/extras/c67a50bb59e1bebffb134492e5a0b13f.mp4?t=1672176547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Take on auto-tune spiders, giant MP3 players, cyborg bouncers, and many more bizarre foes<br></li><li>Collect sheet music to purchase permanent upgrades for future runs<br></li><li>Use your dash to slip past enemies and collect precious XP crystals to level up <br></li><li>Time your reloads perfectly to instantly refill your ammo and take down enemies faster <br></li><li>Choose from up to six unlockable weapons, each with their own unique evolutions per run<br></li><li>Play with a gamepad or keyboard/mouse controls<br></li><li>Fend off the hordes for 20 minutes to survive the night!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231630/extras/3b65948b8681b20ce977fdf6327291b9.poster.avif?t=1672176547\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231630/extras/3b65948b8681b20ce977fdf6327291b9.webm?t=1672176547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231630/extras/3b65948b8681b20ce977fdf6327291b9.mp4?t=1672176547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "Chorus of the Night is a fast-paced twin-stick shooter where you battle through hordes of quirky enemies drawn from the music scenes of the '90s and early 2000s. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231630/extras/c67a50bb59e1bebffb134492e5a0b13f.poster.avif?t=1672176547\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231630/extras/c67a50bb59e1bebffb134492e5a0b13f.webm?t=1672176547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231630/extras/c67a50bb59e1bebffb134492e5a0b13f.mp4?t=1672176547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Take on auto-tune spiders, giant MP3 players, cyborg bouncers, and many more bizarre foes<br></li><li>Collect sheet music to purchase permanent upgrades for future runs<br></li><li>Use your dash to slip past enemies and collect precious XP crystals to level up <br></li><li>Time your reloads perfectly to instantly refill your ammo and take down enemies faster <br></li><li>Choose from up to six unlockable weapons, each with their own unique evolutions per run<br></li><li>Play with a gamepad or keyboard/mouse controls<br></li><li>Fend off the hordes for 20 minutes to survive the night!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231630/extras/3b65948b8681b20ce977fdf6327291b9.poster.avif?t=1672176547\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231630/extras/3b65948b8681b20ce977fdf6327291b9.webm?t=1672176547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231630/extras/3b65948b8681b20ce977fdf6327291b9.mp4?t=1672176547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "Fight through hordes of burnt CDs, flying TVs, and faceless suits in this frantic, run-based, twin-stick shooter. Forget firing bullets, though - you'll be flinging vinyl records, throwing drumsticks and swinging guitars to fend off the enemies of music and maybe, just maybe, survive the night.",
